<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>يا عبيط 😂</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: #111;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .box {
            background: #222;
            color: white;
            padding: 50px 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 40px;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #aaa;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="box">
        <h1>داخل تبص على إيه تاني يا عبيط؟ 😂</h1>
        <p>اقفل الصفحة يا نجم ❤️</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
